<title>INDIA: India issues 7-yr, 12.59% govt stock in conversion.</title>
<headline>India issues 7-yr, 12.59% govt stock in conversion.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Indian government on Wednesday announced the issue of seven-year, 12.59 percent government stock in conversion of 50 billion rupees of treasury bills special securities held by the Reserve Bank of India.  </p>
<p>The government stock will be eligible for ready forward facility, a government statement said.</p>
